OL,5,G2330 Unclassified
OL,6,     FRevered composer, collaborator and
OL,7,     Fmusician Roger Eno is in the
OL,8,     FUnclassified Listening Chair to
OL,9,     Fselect a track that transports him
OL,10,     Felsewhere.
OL,11,G0030 Through the Night
OL,12,     FMezzo-soprano Marianne Beate
OL,13,     FKielland sings Berlioz's poetic
OL,14,     Fsong cycle Les nuits d'ete with
OL,15,     Fthe Norwegian Radio Orchestra.
OL,16,     FAfter, the orchestra performs
OL,17,     FSibelius' second symphony.
